    "bio": "A Representative from Washington; born in Glendale, Los Angeles County, Calif., November 3, 1978; graduated from Prairie High School, Brush Prairie, Wash.; attended Seattle Pacific University, Seattle, Wash., 1996-1998; A.A., Bellevue Community College, Bellevue, Wash., 2003; B.A., University of Washington, Seattle, Wash., 2004; staff, United States Representative Cathy McMorris Rodgers of Washington, 2005-2007; member of the Washington state house of representatives, 2007-2010; elected as a Republican to the One Hundred Twelfth and to the five succeeding Congresses (January 3, 2011-January 3, 2023); unsuccessful candidate for renomination to the One Hundred Eighteenth Congress in 2022.",
